{"id":"12-503-2-11","zh":"依“Sabbassimasse vā”规则，在 su、naṃ、hi 之前，整个 ima 可选变为 e。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-503-12-15","zh":"ehi、imehi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-503-16-18","zh":"承前继用“vā”与“smāsasmiṃsaṃsāsu attaṃ”。","confidence":65}
{"id":"12-504-2-4","zh":"ima 一词也是如此。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-505-2-8","zh":"在 sa、smā、smiṃ、saṃ、sā 之前，ima 可选变为 a。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-505-9-12","zh":"assa、imassa。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-505-13-20","zh":"esaṃ、esānaṃ、imesaṃ、imesānaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-505-21-26","zh":"asmā、imamhā、imasmā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-505-27-30","zh":"ehi、imehi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-505-31-36","zh":"asmiṃ、imamhi、imasmiṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-505-37-40","zh":"esu、imesu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-506-2-3","zh":"在变为 a 的情况下——","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-506-4-16","zh":"依“na timehi katākārehi”规则，（ta、ima 已变为 a 的）后面，smā、smiṃ 不变成 mhā、mhi。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-507-2-8","zh":"159. 阴性：ayaṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-507-9-14","zh":"其余与 etā 相同，区别只在于在 saṃ、sā 之前变为 a。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-508-2-9","zh":"160. 中性：承前继用“savibhattissa”与“vā”。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-509-2-12","zh":"依“Imassidamaṃsisu napuṃsake”规则，ima 可选变为 idaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-509-13-19","zh":"idaṃ、imaṃ；ime、imāni。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-509-20-22","zh":"第二格也是这样。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-510-2-9","zh":"161. amu，si。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-511-2-5","zh":"承前继用“vā”“anapuṃsakassa”“simhi”。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-512-2-15","zh":"依“Amussa mo saṃ”规则，amu 的 m 可选变为 s，si 脱落。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-512-16-17","zh":"asu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-513-2-11","zh":"依“Sabbato ko”规则，在代词之后增加 ka 音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-513-12-25","zh":"依“So”规则，si 变为 o：amuko；另一选项：amu。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-513-26-29","zh":"amū、amuyo。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-514-2-7","zh":"如前所说，yo 不变为 vo。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-514-8-9","zh":"amuṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-514-10-13","zh":"amū、amuyo。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-514-14-17","zh":"其余与 bhikkhu 相同，只是代词类（sabbādi）特有的变化除外。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-515-2-8","zh":"162. 阴性：asu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-515-9-11","zh":"其余与 yāgu 相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-515-12-17","zh":"区别在于：amussā、amuyā。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-515-18-21","zh":"amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-515-22-25","zh":"amussaṃ、amuyaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-515-26-27","zh":"amūsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-516-2-10","zh":"163. 中性：承前继用“savibhattissa”“aṃsisu”“napuṃsake”。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-517-2-9","zh":"依“Amussāduṃ”规则，变为 aduṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-517-10-11","zh":"aduṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-517-12-15","zh":"amū、amūni。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-517-16-18","zh":"第二格也是这样。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-518-2-15","zh":"164. 依“Sesesu ca”规则，在所有其余的格尾之前，ki 都变为 ka。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-518-16-22","zh":"ko、kā、kaṃ，等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-518-23-25","zh":"在三种性中都与 sabba 相同。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-519-2-13","zh":"165. tumha，si；amha，si。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-520-2-4","zh":"“savibhattissa tumhāmhānaṃ”是主导规则（adhikāra）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-521-2-5","zh":"tvaṃ、ahaṃ，在 si 之前。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-522-2-8","zh":"在 si 之前，连同格尾的 tumha、amha 变为 tvaṃ、ahaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-522-9-13","zh":"由于有“ca”字，tumha 也变为 tuvaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-522-14-19","zh":"tvaṃ、tuvaṃ、ahaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-522-20-23","zh":"yo：tumhe。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-523-2-13","zh":"依“Mayaṃ yomhi paṭhame”规则，amha 变为 mayaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-523-14-15","zh":"mayaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-524-2-15","zh":"166. 依“Taṃmamamhi”规则，在 aṃ 之前变为 taṃ、maṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-525-2-14","zh":"依“Tavaṃ mamañca navā”规则，在 aṃ 之前可选变为 tavaṃ、mamaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-526-2-14","zh":"依“Tumhassa tuvaṃ tvamamhi”规则，tumha 变为 tuvaṃ，也变为 tvaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-526-15-26","zh":"taṃ、tavaṃ、tuvaṃ、tvaṃ；maṃ、mamaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-527-2-3","zh":"承前继用“ākaṃ”。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-528-2-12","zh":"依“Vā yoppaṭhamo”规则，第二格的 yo 可选变为 ākaṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-528-13-16","zh":"tumhākaṃ、tumhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-528-17-20","zh":"amhākaṃ、amhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-529-2-17","zh":"167. 依“Nāmhi tayā mayā”规则，在 nā 之前变为 tayā、mayā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-529-18-29","zh":"依“Tayātayīnaṃ takāro tvattaṃ vā”规则，其中的 t 可选变为 tv。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-529-30-35","zh":"tvayā、tayā、mayā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-529-36-39","zh":"tumhehi、amhehi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-530-2-18","zh":"168. 依“Tava mama se”规则，在 sa 之前变为 tava、mama。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-531-2-13","zh":"依“Tuyhaṃ mayhaṃ ca”规则，在 sa 之前也变为 tuyhaṃ、mayhaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-532-2-11","zh":"依“Sassaṃ”规则，sa 可选变为 aṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-533-2-15","zh":"依“Amhassa mamaṃ savibhattissa se”规则，在 sa 之前，amha 连同格尾也变为 mamaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-533-16-29","zh":"tava、tuyhaṃ、tumhaṃ；mama、mayhaṃ、amhaṃ、mamaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-534-2-11","zh":"依“Tumhamhehi nam ākaṃ”规则，naṃ 格尾变为 ākaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-534-12-15","zh":"tumhākaṃ、amhākaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"12-534-16-17","zh":"smā 与 nā 相同。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-535-2-17","zh":"169. 依“Tumhāmhānaṃ tayi mayi”规则，在 smiṃ 之前变为 tayi、mayi。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-535-18-30","zh":"变为 tv 时：tvayi；以及 tayi、mayi、tumhesu、amhesu。","confidence":80}
{"id":"12-535-31-33","zh":"在三种性中都相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"12-536-2-6","zh":"170. 承前继用“navā”。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-537-2-7","zh":"在词之后，于第二格、第四格、第六格，变为 vo、no。","confidence":70}
{"id":"12-538-2-18","zh":"能显示意义的音素称为词（pada）；当第二格、第四格、第六格的复数格尾跟在后面时，词之后连同格尾的 tumha、amha 可选变为 vo、no。","confidence":75}
{"id":"12-539-2-20","zh":"愿他守护你们（vo），愿他看见我们（no），他给你们（vo），请给我们（no），你们的（vo）信心，我们的（no）导师。","confidence":75}
